TI  - Next Generation Lightweight Cryptography for Smart IoT Devices: : Implementation, Challenges and Applications
PY  - 2019
T2  - IEEE 5th World Forum on Internet of Things, WF-IoT 2019 - Conference Proceedings
C7  - 8767250
SP  - 707
EP  - 710
